story: 
summary: 500 On 3 Aug 2025, I signed a tenancy agreement with Mr Tan Ah Kow for an HDB flat and paid him a security deposit of $2,600 by bank transfer. The agreement said he must refund the deposit within 14 days after I move out, minus any damage cost.

On 31 Jul 2026, I moved out. I cleaned the flat and left the keys in the mailbox as he told me to. He replied "ok, all good" and said he would transfer the deposit after checking.

